member.example:

interface IUploadApi
{
  [Multipart]
  [Post("/setup")]
  Task SetupAsync([FormObject] SetupModel model, [AliasAs("recipe")] StreamPart recipe);
}

Each public property of SetupModel is sent as its own form field alongside the recipe file part.

